 "stimulus_html": "In the following exercises, Ruslana wants to use her 401(k) to save $1,400,000 when she retires in 36 years. She assumes the plan will yield 11% compounded annually. Her company will match contributions up to 5% of annual salary. Her salary is $48,000.",
 "questions": [
